+* When a card or hook file really was drafted from a different narration, the message names the file, the part
+  that changed, the saved-versus-current word and character counts, and two paste-ready commands:
+  ``cli.py v3 refresh-cards <job> --language or`` and ``cli.py v3 language-outputs <job> --fit-hold 8``.
